{
  "version": "18.0.8-rc.0",
  "releaseNotes": "**Release notes**\n* 🎨 Refreshed the list, grid and tile layouts of events, books, deals, news, podcasts, RSS news, WordPress, places, menus, people, products, Shopify products, affiliate levels, iCal events, loyalty, photos, RSS photos, RSS videos and YouTube, with better readability over photos.\n* 🎨 Redesigned details screens of About, events, news articles, places, podcast episodes, deals, books, menus, people, products, videos, Shopify products, affiliate levels, pages, loyalty stores and rewards: a full-width photo with the title on it, content in rounded cards, quick-contact buttons, and a header that turns solid as the photo scrolls away.\n\n**Developer notes**\n* ✨ Introduced shared Tile, Medium and Fixed-grid layouts; the list screens of those extensions now render through them.\n* 🧪 Added a unit-test setup with shared mocks for extension screens; it keeps working after configure.\n* ✨ Introduced a shared details layout and details header; every details screen in scope now renders through them.",
